[/bold #AF87FF]Runtime-resolved `markdown.print_width` config field[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config-field[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-field: add the `markdown.print_width` schema/default/getter, turn[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase.markdown_width` into a runtime accessor instead of an import-time [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]constant, migrate every consumer and test off the frozen constants, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the width guard suite to catch import-time snapshots. Effective [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]width stays 100, so no Markdown reflows.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Flip the shipped default from 100 to 88[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]default-88[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config-field[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]default-88: change the default constant, `default_config.yml`, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema default, and the `package.json` prettier mirror to 88, then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reflow the repo's Markdown, regenerate every SASE-generated artifact, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and correct the prose and tables that name 100 as the width.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Align chezmoi's prettier and conform configuration with the [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]new default[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]chezmoi-align[dim] · [dim][/dim]after default-88[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi-align: move the chezmoi-managed prettier width declarations (its[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Justfile recipes and the Neovim conform.lua prettier args) from 100 to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]88, apply the change, and verify the deployed skills and dotfiles agree [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the new default.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gy","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-gy.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4ac98ba7feeaff7367e46d546974eb2b","started_at":"2026-08-07T14:34:46.929031+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"bc4dedcea60f9d9ff38e1126e67a226ef3d6f18eae2846da38c4af49dd7487a5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/chat.md","size_bytes":5296},"commits":{"digest":"f0eba02612dadb4674fcefb54a4d69a55fe5f4afd9d3e0b695bd80f3cace8b04","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"9948a13930fb5bb080172babd7d6f37cd40949dad81932a4456e389fd01a0d8e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"4b69d081ebcdcf06274f554986d4147bd7ff55f368f6673f6394b8cfafbe0b61","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":153},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"12a7992e403e94ae0867aace7e9c2b040ef199fd6b8d1307d7854634239be214","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":9640},"state":{"digest":"6abcc10e62aa0f7f28060c22d39ed7182d726c2ae67bf88a9fe1dc46e561a6b3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3/state.json","size_bytes":183}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-gy.3","local_name":"sase-gy.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-gy","agent_clan_generation":"20260807102730","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-gy.3","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gy","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","phase_bead_id":"sase-gy.3","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5979a482b834573c84bff1f92dcb78e9","started_at":"2026-0